---
classDiagram
direction LR

namespace `Task 3 — Диаграмма классов Java-реализации — com_example_shipmentexporter` {
  class ShipmentExportApplication {
    +main(args String[]) void$
    ~run() int$
  }

  class ExportSettings {
    <<record>>
    -String dbUrl
    -String dbUser
    -String dbPassword
    -Path outputDirectory
    -ZoneId timeZone
    -int fetchSize
    ~fromEnvironment() ExportSettings$
    ~from(environment Map~String, String~) ExportSettings$
  }

  class ShipmentCsvExporter {
    -String EXPORT_QUERY$
    ~export(connection Connection, outputDirectory Path, exportDate LocalDate, fetchSize int) ExportResult
  }

  class ExportResult {
    <<record>>
    -Path outputFile
    -long rowCount
  }

  class CsvWriter {
    ~writeRecord(writer Writer, values List~String~) void$
  }
}

ShipmentExportApplication ..> ExportSettings : читает настройки
ShipmentExportApplication ..> ShipmentCsvExporter : запускает экспорт
ShipmentCsvExporter ..> CsvWriter : записывает CSV
ShipmentCsvExporter *-- ExportResult : возвращает
